					"content": "def randomString(int length) {\n    def chars = \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789\"\n    def random = new Random()\n    def sb = new StringBuilder(length)\n\n    (1..length).each {\n        sb.append(chars.charAt(random.nextInt(chars.length())))\n    }\n\n    return sb.toString()\n}\n\ndef randomString = randomString(20)\n\nrequest.setHeader('randomString', randomString)\nresult = request.body"
